# small, hand-annotated real-webcam calibration captures are worth keeping in git, unlike the
# rest of data/ (generated scenes, downloaded card images, checkpoints/exports), so this excludes
# data/'s direct children individually instead of the whole tree -- a bare `data/` rule would
# make `!data/real-captures/` below unable to re-include anything under it.
data/*
!data/real-captures/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
.amp/
*.log
